        <mxCell id="note0" value="Every use case of the Reader, the Writer, the Magazine and the&lt;br&gt;Administrator includes «Sign in». The assistant needs the premium&lt;br&gt;plan: «Consume the AI allowance» has the condition [plan = premium].&lt;br&gt;The administrator role is granted in the database, never through the&lt;br&gt;interface." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="945" width="438" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
